{
  "about": "What officeproof knows about each tracked-change site: which engines reject and accept it alike, and whether a planted test case exercises it. RevisionAllowlist admits a site only when a planted case exercises it, every probe it cites agrees across every engine, and it carries no \"word\" note (Word's Reject All of the planted case did not restore the original). Every other site is refused, with or without verify --word. The Word tests (OFFICEPROOF_WORD_TESTS=1) check the word-* columns against the installed Word; the other columns are checked by every test run. After re-measuring on a new Word build, record its version and date under engines.",
  "outcomes": {
    "R": "restores the original",
    "A": "applies the change",
    "U": "leaves every revision in place",
    "K": "drops the deletion and keeps the insertion",
    "X": "blocks on a modal dialog",
    "G": "leaves the row a cell short",
    "T": "throws",
    "M": "rebuilds the table grid, moving the row's cell edges"
  },
